=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_convertible\"><span class=\"kw598\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_convertible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OtherIndexTypes, index_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> ...<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, \n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_constructible\"><span class=\"kw532\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>index_type, OtherIndexTypes<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> ...<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, and\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>OtherIndexTypes<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rank<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Let <code>I</code> be <code class=\"t-c\"><code>extents_type::</code><code><i>index-cast</i></code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>indices<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Then the behavior is undefined if <code>I</code> is not a multidimensional index in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">extents<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, i.e., <code class=\"t-c